      "instance_name": "asshole_stereotype",
      "label": "Stereotype of 'asshole' behavior",
      "description": "The term 'asshole' is a colloquial and disparaging stereotype used to describe someone who is rude, selfish, or unpleasant. This concept is central to the meme's text and is a common social trope used to describe undesirable personality traits.",
