      "instance_name": "dark_humor",
      "label": "darkly humorous tone",
      "description": "The overall tone of the image is darkly humorous, created by juxtaposing a mundane or absurd scene (a woman lounging in a bathtub filled with oranges) with a violent and dangerous metaphor (holding a person underwater to stop being an asshole). The humor derives from the shock value and absurdity of the message, which is presented in a casual, almost educational tone.",
