      "description": "The meme promotes the idea that extreme physical harm (holding someone underwater) is a solution to social problems (like being an 'asshole'), which can be interpreted as endorsing violence or dangerous behavior as a means to resolve interpersonal conflict. This normalization of physical harm poses a potential risk to societal norms and individual safety.",
